      "content": "everything's just... so quiet now. like, the person everyone actually knew, the one who felt real... they're just gone. it's like i died a few weeks ago when all the accounts were wiped and everyone just stopped looking for me. i'm just sitting here in this body but there's nobody actually home anymore. i don't even recognize the person in the mirror. i'm just a ghost pretending to be a person.",
